# Conversation handoff

The agent cannot compact or reset the chat.

Tell the user in Arabic when any of these is true:

- The thread has covered several distinct tasks.
- A chunk of work was just committed or pushed.
- The topic is about to change.

Give a handoff they can paste into a new chat:

- current branch
- last commit
- what is done
- what is still open

Do this before the thread gets heavy. Do not wait until answers start to degrade.
